{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as Mani, the brilliantly stupid alien scientist. After crash-landing a disposable spacecraft on a primitive, uncharted planet, he\u2019s stranded with nothing but his trusted robot companion Stefan and a blender. To make matters even worse, if he\u2019s not back home by Wednesday to cover his grandpa\u2019s shift at the store, \u201cthey\u201d will take away the family business.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Now Mani must figure out how to fight against the lack of technology on this planet. Using his understanding of \u201cmolecular equivalence\u201d, he blends carrots and seaweed into rocket boots and weapons. It\u2019s not fancy, but it might just get him back to space in time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Game features</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Open world</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover a vibrant open world in the form of an archipelago where every island has its own unique ecosystem, secrets, and dangers. From icy peaks to warm sand dunes, every biome holds new resources and mysteries.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3256470/extras/f672f80e3e096c4b2dccdbba27895f11.avif?t=1759089291\" width=1024 height=512 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Crafting</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mani\u2019s unique crafting system lets you make anything from a flamethrower to a grappling hook from natural resources. However, knowing the molecular structure and its equivalence is an entire science. Find the corresponding recipe, or blend some coconuts and rocks together and pray for a weapon and not a smoothie.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3256470/extras/2094c3cf15d45be3a07c04ab5e89bed9.avif?t=1759089291\" width=1024 height=512 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Action combat</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wield your giant wrench or equip your robot companion Stefan with an array of makeshift weapons. Fight fierce Cognimals and challenging bosses in fast-paced, action-packed cog-to-cog combat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3256470/extras/d0c07aa3efced0d4036afed181c1a067.avif?t=1759089291\" width=1024 height=512 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Uncover secrets</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The planet isn\u2019t just vibrant and primitive\u2014it\u2019s hiding something. Uncover its secrets by deciphering an alien language and reveal the story of the universe, hidden in plain sight.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3256470/extras/1f8273dd5e2776de34fc1f4efad19ac6.avif?t=1759089291\" width=1024 height=512 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3256470?t=1759089291","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3256470?t=1759089291","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3256470/a0e2f1cfea693925db32ff235c24b13c1f51cfc3/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1759089291","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3256470/a0e2f1cfea693925db32ff235c24b13c1f51cfc3/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1759089291","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},